    "created_at": "2016-09-15T02:20:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-15T02:20:40Z",
    "body": "And looks like for a disabled input both Safari and WebKit reflect the content attribute, instead of returning -1, even though it's very much not focusable.  Same for Chrome.\n\n@cdumez, when you say \"HTML elements that are not focusable\", what do you mean, exactly?\n",
