    "body": "Testcase, just for posterity:\n\n```\n<style>\n  input { display: none; }\n</style>\n<input tabindex=\"-2\">\n<input tabindex=\"-1\">\n<input tabindex=\"0\">\n<input tabindex=\"1\">\n<input tabindex=\"2\">\n<input tabindex=\"3\" disabled>\n<input tabindex=\"4\">\n<script>\n  var list = document.getElementsByTagName(\"input\");\n  for (var idx = 0; idx < list.length; ++idx) {\n    console.log(list[idx].tabIndex);\n  }\n</script>\n```\n",
