    "body": "Or this:\n\n```\n<script>\n  var s = document.createElement(\"span\");\n  s.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", \"5\");\n  alert(s.tabIndex);\n</script>\n```\n\nalerts 5 in WebKit afaict.\n",
