    "created_at": "2019-06-25T20:12:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-06-25T20:12:09Z",
    "body": "I think reflecting the `tabindex` content attribute the easiest path forward for interoperability.\r\n\r\nThe state of whether an element is focus or not is, as @bzbarsky has already noted, [a very much non-binary and complex situation](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4607\r\n) so I don't think spec'ing what WebKit and Chrome do right now makes much sense although I'm afraid there might be some Web content out there which depends on WebKit/Chrome's behavior already :(\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
